01:00:42,352 --> 01:00:48,352
Twitches is a 2005 American fantasy comedy-drama film released as a Disney Channel original
movie and based on the Twitches book series published by Scholastic Press.

13
01:05:45,882 --> 01:05:51,882
Produced by Broomsticks Productions Limited, the film stars Tia Mowry and
Tamera Mowry as Alexandra Fielding and Camryn Barnes, respectively.

14
01:10:49,411 --> 01:10:55,411
A sequel, Twitches Too, aired on October 12, 2007, as a
part of Disney Channel's Hauntober Fest.

15
01:15:52,941 --> 01:15:58,941
The film explores themes of witch, mother, sibling
relationship, parent child relationship, darkness.

16
01:20:56,470 --> 01:21:02,470
The tone is lighthearted and dark and emotional.
